about: an inline array is split between its members, never on a comma or bracket inside a string
op: deleteJsonValueAt
path: ["includes"]
literal: "dist/**"
=== input
{
  "includes": ["**/*.{ts,tsx}", "[a,b]", "dist/**", "!**/{x,y}/**"]
}
=== output
{
  "includes": ["**/*.{ts,tsx}", "[a,b]", "!**/{x,y}/**"]
}
=== at
2
